, and actress. She made her debut as a member of the South Korean girl group WJSN in 2016. In early 2018, she began her solo activities in China and took a hiatus from the group since then. After a five-year hiatus from WJSN, she left the group in March 2023. As an actress, she is best known for her role as Tong Yao in Falling into Your Smile (2021).","title":"Cheng Xiao","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheng_Xiao"}},"Q30313948":{"id":"Q30313948","name":"Ha Sung-woon","ko":"하성운","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1994-03-22","death":"","birthplace":"Goyang","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2014","agencies":[{"name":"BPM Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q108876386","start":"2021","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q20684188","name":"Hotshot","start":"2014","end":"2021"},{"id":"Q30311578","name":"Wanna One","start":"2017","end":"2019"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/official.hasungwoon/","x":"https://x.com/gooreumseng","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCop_-8RXaAEpatMq7scX_Gg","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/3OBkZ9NG8F0Fn4oNpg0yuU","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/199b8c86-4aff-4e97-9534-ee8f2677077a"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Ha Sung-woon, also known mononymously as Sungwoon, is a South Korean singer and songwriter. He is best known as a member of South Korean boy group Wanna One, as a member of boy group Hotshot, and currently as a solo artist. In 2019, he began his solo music career with his first extended play My Moment.","title":"Ha Sung-woon","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ha_Sung-woon"}},"Q31179676":{"id":"Q31179676","name":"Lee Tae-il","ko":"태일","birthName":"이태일","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1990-09-24","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2011","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q498326","name":"Block B","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www