z, is a South Korean singer and former member of Monday Kiz. He released his first album as a solo artist on May 3, 2016. Originally a duo of Lee Jin-sung and Kim Min-su, it was disbanded on August 4, 2008 when Kim Min-soo died in a motorcycle accident on April 29, 2008. It was re-engaged as a trio in April 2010.","title":"Monday Kiz (singer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monday_Kiz_%28singer%29"}}}}